# Everything here is REGENERATED by the harness. `./clean.ps1` deletes exactly
# this set and prints what each category costs to rebuild; nothing listed below
# is source. Written 2026-08-13, before git was installed, so that the first
# commit does not carry ~1.5 GB of Chrome profiles and DOM dumps.
#
# NOTE what is deliberately NOT ignored: `vector-calculus.html`. It is generated
# by ./build.ps1, but it is also THE DEPLOYABLE ARTIFACT — the single file a
# static host serves. It is committed on purpose. Never edit it by hand; edit
# `src/` and rebuild.

# --- Chrome profiles, one per harness script (see MASTER-PLAN 1.6) -----------
cprof*/

# --- the app wrapped with an injected probe, one copy per harness ------------
apptest-*.html

# --- --dump-dom output ------------------------------------------------------
# The bare names are not covered by `dom-*.txt` and are easy to miss: this list
# was cross-checked against the delete list in clean.ps1, not written from memory.
dom-*.txt
dom.txt
smokedom.txt
probedom.txt
audittext-dom.txt
audittext-dump.json

# --- the extracted engine + unit suite, rebuilt by ./runtests.ps1 -----------
enginetest.html

# --- screenshots from ./runapp.ps1 ------------------------------------------
shot-*.png

# --- machine-readable audit output ------------------------------------------
audit-*.csv
audittext-findings.csv
audittext-*.txt
audittext-*.csv

